<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR OPENS UP AT $59-1/4 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR OPENS UP AT $59-1/4 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened up $0-1/4 at $59-1/4 in New York on Wednesday, but soon fell to $58-5/8.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponds to about 302.48 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
